B.aCE=new A.eh("Mukhtasir baat","\u2022 ShieldPal mein koi account, login ya apna server nahi hai. Hum aapka zaati data na jama karte hain, na bechte hain.\n\u2022 Messages, notifications, apps ki list, contacts aur Deep Scan ke nateeje AAPKE PHONE PAR check hote hain aur wahin rehte hain.\n\u2022 Chand optional features sirf tab, jab aap unhein istemal karein, kisi doosri service ko thora sa data bhejte hain. Sab section 3 mein likha hai.\n\u2022 Koi ads nahi. Koi tracking ya analytics nahi. Data kabhi becha ya share nahi hota.")
B.aCJ=new A.eh("1. Kya phone par rehta hai","\u2022 Live Guard nayi notifications (WhatsApp, SMS, Telegram\u2026) ka text scam links aur messages dhoondne ke liye parhta hai. Check phone par hi hota hai. Agar kuch khatarnak mile to chhota sa hissa aur app/chat ka naam phone ke Threat Log mein save hota hai. Kuch upload nahi hota.\n\u2022 Message Check, scam pehchanne wala AI model, Number Check, Safe QR (camera ki tasveer phone se bahar nahi jati), Password strength, Family Safe-Word, pet, coins aur settings sab phone par chalte hain.\n\u2022 2FA Vault ke secrets, jo API keys aap daalein aur app-lock PIN encrypted (Android Keystore) store hote hain. PIN sirf hash ki surat mein rakha jata hai.\n\u2022 Deep Scan installed apps, unki permissions aur phone ki security settings device par hi parhta hai. Nateeja kabhi upload nahi hota.\n\u2022 Contacts (optional): ijazat dein to ShieldPal check kiye ja rahe number ka aapke contacts mein save naam dhoondta hai. Yeh phone par hota hai; contacts upload ya store nahi hote.")
B.aCv=new A.eh("2. Account aur pehchan","ShieldPal ko sign-up nahi chahiye. Hum nahi jaante aap kaun hain, aur hum aapka naam, e-mail, phone number, location ya advertising ID jama nahi karte.")
B.aCA=new A.eh("3. Kya phone se bahar ja sakta hai (optional)",'Sirf tab jab aap woh feature istemal karein. Sab kuch HTTPS par jata hai.\n\n\u2022 Link Check \xb7 Cloudflare Security DNS: link ka sirf domain naam (jaise "example.com"), poora address ya koi zaati cheez nahi. Settings \u2192 Online services & AI mein band kar sakte hain.\n\u2022 Link Check \xb7 Google Safe Browsing (sirf agar aap apni key daalein): link ka address.\n\u2022 Link Check \xb7 urlscan.io cloud browser (sirf agar apni key daalein aur on karein): link ka address. urlscan.io page ko aapke phone se door kholta hai aur scan unlisted rakhta hai.\n\u2022 Password Check \xb7 Have I Been Pwned: password ke SHA-1 fingerprint ke sirf pehle 5 huroof (k-anonymity). Password khud kabhi nahi.\n\u2022 Pal AI \xb7 Free online AI (pollinations.ai): Pal AI ke saath aapki chat ka text, sirf aapki ijazat ke baad. Chat mein password ya code mat likhein. Settings mein kabhi bhi band karein; Pal AI offline bhi chalta hai.\n\u2022 Pal AI \xb7 Claude (Anthropic) (sirf agar apni key daalein): aapke chat messages, aapki apni key ke saath. Anthropic ki privacy policy lagu hoti hai.\n\u2022 Shield VPN: yeh phone par local VPN hai. Yeh aapka traffic ShieldPal ya kisi VPN server ko nahi bhejta. Sirf aapke device ke DNS lookups (apps jo domain naam poochti hain) us DNS provider ko jate hain jo aap chunein (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9, AdGuard ya OpenDNS) \u2014 bilkul waise hi jaise phone normally apne network ko bhejta hai. Yeh aapka IP address nahi chhupata.\n\u2022 Remote VPN (optional): woh WireGuard config chalata hai jo AAP paste karein. Phir aapka sara traffic us config ke VPN server par jata hai, is liye wo provider use dekh sakta hai. ShieldPal config sirf aapke phone par encrypted rakhta hai aur kahin nahi bhejta.\n\u2022 Mera IP dekhein (optional button): ipwho.is se aapka public IP aur mulk poochta hai.\n\u2022 Bolti warnings Android ka text-to-speech engine phone par istemal karti hain.\n\nIn services ki apni privacy policies hain. ShieldPal ko in mein se kuch bhi data nahi milta.')
B.aCx=new A.eh("4. Permissions aur kyun",'\u2022 Internet \u2014 upar likhe optional online checks.\n\u2022 Notifications \u2014 khatre ke alerts dikhane ke liye.\n\u2022 Notification access \u2014 Live Guard (scam dhoondne ke liye notifications device par parhna). Aap Android settings mein khud on karte hain aur kabhi bhi band kar sakte hain.\n\u2022 Installed apps ki list (QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES) \u2014 Deep Scan aur nayi app ki warning. List device par rehti hai.\n\u2022 Delete packages \u2014 khatarnak app ke liye ek-tap "Remove" button (confirm aap hi karte hain).\n\u2022 Screen-lock ki mazbooti \u2014 batane ke liye ke lock kamzor to nahi (PIN kabhi nahi).\n\u2022 Camera \u2014 Safe QR scanner. Tasveerein save ya upload nahi hoti.\n\u2022 Biometrics \u2014 app lock ke liye fingerprint / face.\n\u2022 Contacts (optional) \u2014 number ka save naam dikhane ke liye.\n\u2022 VPN service \u2014 local DNS filter (Shield VPN). Android ka VPN dialog aap khud approve karte hain.')
B.aCL=new A.eh("5. Hifazat","Online requests HTTPS istemal karti hain. Secrets Android Keystore se encrypted hain. PIN hash hota hai. App lock fingerprint ya face se khul sakta hai. ShieldPal apna data cloud par backup nahi karta (allowBackup band hai).")
B.aCw=new A.eh("6. Bachay aur teenagers","ShieldPal sab ke liye hai, teenagers aur families samet. Yeh account nahi banata aur jaan boojh kar kisi se, 13 saal se kam umar ke bachon samet, zaati data jama nahi karta.")
B.aCN=new A.eh("7. Aapke ikhtiyarat aur data delete karna",'\u2022 Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 "Delete all my data" ShieldPal ka phone par save har cheez mita deta hai: settings, threat log, 2FA codes, keys, PIN aur pet ki progress.\n\u2022 App uninstall karne se bhi sab kuch hat jata hai.\n\u2022 Aap Android settings mein kabhi bhi koi permission wapas le sakte hain ya Live Guard aur Shield VPN band kar sakte hain.\n\u2022 Hamare paas aapka koi data kisi server par nahi hota, is liye hum se kuch mangwane ki zaroorat nahi. Kisi doosri service ke paas jo data ho, uske liye usi service se rabta karein.')
B.aCC=new A.eh("8. Policy mein tabdeeli","Agar features badlein to hum yeh policy yahan aur app mein update karte hain aur upar ki tareekh badal dete hain.")
B.aCy=new A.eh("9. Rabta",u.x)
B.adr=s([B.aCE,B.aCJ,B.aCv,B.aCA,B.aCx,B.aCL,B.aCw,B.aCN,B.aCC,B.aCy],t.mA)
