B.ann=new A.a3(B.cr,["Theek hai","Cancel","Save karein","Save ho gaya","Ho gaya","Aage","Haan","Nahi","On","Off","Nahi hai","Add karein","Add ho gaya!","Banayein","Delete","Hatayein","Tafseel","Copy","Copy ho gaya","Paste","Kholein","Theek karein","Ijazat dein","Manage","On karein","Off karein","Set up karein","Maloom nahi","khatra","Sab dekhein","abhi abhi","{x} minute pehle","{x} ghante pehle","{x} din pehle","Connect nahi ho saka. Internet check karke dobara koshish karein.","Home","Shield","Khelo","Vault","Settings","Pal AI se poochein","Level {x}","Mera phone scan karo","Pichla scan: {x}","{pet} bohot khush hai! Aapka phone mehfooz hai \ud83d\udc9a","{pet} theek hai. Kuch cheezein behtar ho sakti hain.","{pet} pareshan hai \ud83d\ude1f Kuch masle theek karne hain.","{pet} beemar hai \ud83e\udd12 Aapka phone khatre mein hai! Scan karein.","\u26a0\ufe0f {pet} ne khatra pakda! Usay mat kholna!","Hehe! Mere hote koi andar nahi aa sakta! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","Aapka phone chamak raha hai \u2728","High five! Hum zabardast team hain \ud83d\udc3e","Main theek hun, chalo saath mein scan karein?","Mujhe protection khilao \u2014 Live Guard on karo!","Kuch gadbad lag rahi hai\u2026 chalo check karte hain!","Please masle theek karo taake main behtar mehsoos karun \ud83e\udd7a","Aachoo! Bure apps ya links ne mujhe beemar kar diya \ud83e\udd27","Dawai please: Deep Scan chalao aur laal cheezein theek karo!","RUKO! Yeh link jaal hai! \ud83d\udea8","Hi! Main {pet} hun, aapka cyber muhafiz!","Roz ka inaam","Roz aayein aur bada inaam payein!","+{x} coins! Streak: {d} din \ud83d\udd25","Lein","Hifazat","Live Guard, alerts, Shield VPN","Live Guard","Shield VPN","App lock","2FA","Haal ke khatre","Abhi tak koi khatra nahi. {pet} nazar rakh raha hai \ud83d\udc40","Aaj ki cyber tip","OTP ya verification code kabhi kisi ko na batayein \u2014 'bank wale' ya 'Garena support' ko bhi nahi.","Free diamonds, UC ya robux wali websites account chura leti hain. Top-up sirf game ke andar ya official shop se hota hai.","Facebook, Instagram, Gmail aur game accounts par 2FA (do marhala tasdeeq) on karein.","Jo message jaldi machaye ('24 ghante mein', 'sirf aaj') woh purani scam chaal hai.","Kisi 'rishtedar' ki musibat wali call aaye jo paise maange? Family Safe-Word emojis poochein.","Har account ka password alag rakhein. Password manager madad karta hai.","Apps sirf Play Store ya App Store se install karein. Chat se aayi APK files mein jasoos apps chhupi ho sakti hain.","Bina password ka public Wi-Fi doosron ko aapka data dikha sakta hai. Us par login na karein.","Login se pehle asli web address dekhein: facebook.com, na ke faceb00k-login.xyz.","Phone update rakhein. Security updates hackers ke raste band karti hain.","Aapke saare security tools ek jagah.","Deep Scan","Jasoos apps, kamzor settings aur khatre dhoondo","Link Check","Kholne se pehle link check karein","Message Check","Kya yeh SMS / WhatsApp scam hai?","Safe QR","QR code mehfooz tareeqe se scan karein","Number Check","Number ki maloomat aur khatre","Password Check","Mazbooti aur leak check","Family Safe-Word","AI awaaz wale scam roko","Khatron ki list","ShieldPal ne jo kuch pakda","Mehfooz lagta hai","Mashkook","Khatarnak!","Screen lock check ho raha hai\u2026","System aur updates check ho rahe hain\u2026","Installed apps scan ho rahe hain\u2026","Jasoos apps aur chhupi access dhoond rahe hain\u2026","Network aur VPN check ho raha hai\u2026","Google Play Protect se pooch rahe hain\u2026","hifazat","Sab theek! Aapka phone achi tarah mehfooz hai \ud83c\udf89","{x} cheezon par dhyan dena zaroori hai","{x} apps scan hue","Google Play Protect ko nuqsan deh apps mile","Khatarnak apps","In apps ke paas khatarnak taqat hai. Agar aap inhein nahi jaante to hata dein.","Security check-up","Dobara scan","Yeh app device admin hai. Pehle iske admin rights band karein, phir hatayein.","Khabardar! {pet} ko aapke phone mein masle mile hain. Please theek karein.","Settings \u2192 App lock mein ja kar on karein.","Vault tab khol kar apne 2FA accounts add karein.","Shield \u2192 Family Safe-Word khol kar bana lein.","Screen lock on hai","Koi screen lock nahi!","Jo bhi aapka phone uthaye sab kuch khol sakta hai. PIN ya password lagayein.","Mazboot screen lock","Kamzor screen lock ({x})","Pattern aur chhote PIN aasani se guess ya dekh liye jaate hain. 6+ digit PIN ya password use karein.","Security update naya hai ({x})","Purana security update ({x})","Naya system update install karein taake security ke sooraakh band hon.","Android version supported hai ({x})","Purana Android version ({x})","Purane Android ko ab security fixes nahi milte. Mumkin ho to update karein.","Developer options off hain","Developer options on hain","Agar aap apps nahi banate to inhein off kar dein.","USB debugging off hai","USB debugging on hai!","Phone se laga computer usay control kar sakta hai. USB debugging off karein.","Phone root nahi hai","Phone root lagta hai","Root karne se Android ki hifazati deewarein hat jaati hain. Malware poora control le sakta hai.","Koi anjaan app aapki screen control nahi kar rahi","Screen parhne aur control karne wali apps: {x}","Jasoos apps is taqat se chats aur passwords parhti hain. Jin par bharosa na ho unhein off karein.","Koi anjaan device admin app nahi","Device admin apps: {x}","Admin apps phone lock ya saaf kar sakti hain aur mushkil se hatti hain. Anjaan ko hata dein.","Koi aur app aapki notifications nahi parh rahi","Notifications parhne wali apps: {x}","Yeh aapke messages aur OTP dekh sakti hain. Sirf bharose wali apps rakhein.","Keyboard bharose ka hai","Doosri company ka keyboard: {x}","Keyboard aapka har lafz dekhta hai, passwords bhi. Mashhoor keyboard use karein.","Koi app doosre apps install nahi kar sakti","Apps install karne wali apps: {x}","Zaroorat na ho to in ke liye 'Install unknown apps' band karein.","Google Play Protect on hai","Google Play Protect off hai","Play Protect apps mein malware dhoondta hai. Play Store settings mein on karein.","Koi anjaan VPN chal nahi raha","Koi doosra VPN chal raha hai: {x}","VPN aapka internet traffic dekh sakta hai. Sirf bharose wala VPN use karein.","Wi-Fi connection mehfooz hai","Bina password ka khula Wi-Fi","Is network par doosre log aapka kaam dekh sakte hain. Login na karein ya Shield VPN on karein.","Is device par mehdood check","Is device par mehdood check","iPhone aur computer apps ko doosri apps check karne nahi dete. Link, message, QR, 2FA aur family tools poori tarah kaam karte hain.","ShieldPal app lock on hai","ShieldPal app lock off hai","Apne 2FA codes ko PIN ya fingerprint se mehfooz karein.","Aap 2FA codes use karte hain","Abhi koi 2FA account nahi","Vault tab mein apne zaroori accounts ka 2FA add karein.","Family Safe-Word set hai","Abhi Family Safe-Word nahi","Apni family ko AI awaaz-nakal calls se bachayein.","Play Store ke bahar se install hui","Aapke SMS parh sakti hai (OTP codes!)","Aapki call history parh sakti hai","Microphone use kar sakti hai","Camera use kar sakti hai","Aapki location track kar sakti hai","Aapke contacts parh sakti hai","Aapki screen control karti hai (accessibility)","Device administrator hai","Aapki saari notifications parhti hai","Doosri apps ke upar screen bana sakti hai (nakli screens)","Iska icon nahi \u2014 khud ko chhupati hai","Doosri apps install kar sakti hai","Google Play Protect kehta hai yeh nuqsan deh hai","Abhi abhi install hui","Link paste karein. ShieldPal isay aapke phone par KHOLE BAGHAIR check karta hai.","Mehfooz cloud browser mein kholein","Page door ke computer par khulta hai, aapke phone par kabhi nahi, aur hum aapko screenshot dikhate hain.","Link check karein","Chhote link ka asli pata dhoond rahe hain\u2026","Google Safe Browsing se pooch rahe hain\u2026","Mehfooz cloud browser mein khol rahe hain (60 second tak)\u2026","Koi khatre ka nishaan nahi mila. Phir bhi message se aaye page par kabhi password na likhein.","Isay mat kholein aur koi maloomat na dein.","Asli manzil","Humein kya mila","Koi khatre ka nishaan nahi mila.","\u26d4 Google is link ko khatarnak maanta hai ({x}).","\u2705 Google ki khatarnak sites ki list mein nahi.","Google check maujood nahi (Settings \u2192 API keys mein muft key daalein).","Cloud browser maujood nahi (Settings \u2192 API keys mein muft urlscan.io key daalein).","Mehfooz cloud browser","\u26d4 Cloud browser ne is page ko khatarnak paya!","Cloud browser ne is page par aitraaz nahi kiya.","Page ka naam","Aakhir mein pahuncha","Screenshot abhi load ho raha hai \u2014 thodi der baad dekhein.","Page aisa dikhta hai. Yeh aapke phone se door khola gaya tha.","Phir bhi kholein","Sach mein kholna hai?","ShieldPal ke mutabiq yeh link khatarnak hai. Agar yeh password, PIN, OTP ya payment maange \u2014 foran band kar dein.","Mehfooz rahein","Gehri jaanch","Link toota hua ya bhes badla hua hai","Naam ki jagah sirf number wala address","Doosri zabanon ke milte julte huroof use kiye hain","'@' ki chaal se asli site chhupai hai","Encrypted nahi (http)","Sasta domain jo scammers aksar use karte hain ({x})","'{x}' hone ka dikhawa, magar official site nahi","'{x}' ka naam hai magar kahin aur hosted hai","'{x}' ki ghalat spelling wali nakal (jaise g00gle)","Chhota link asli pata chhupata hai","Ajeeb lambi sub-domains ki zanjeer","Naam mein bohot dash (nakli sites mein aam)","Laalach wale alfaaz: {x}","Bohot lamba, uljha hua address","Seedha app ya program download karta hai","Ajeeb port use karta hai","Chhupa hua code hai","Koi bhi SMS, WhatsApp, email ya DM paste karein. ShieldPal ka trained AI kai zabanon mein check karta hai.","Message yahan paste karein\u2026","Jaanch karein","Tip: WhatsApp mein message ko daba kar rakhein \u2192 Share \u2192 ShieldPal.","Aam message lagta hai.","Is message mein scam ki chaalein hain. Jawab, click ya payment na karein.","ShieldPal AI","Phone ke andar wale AI ke mutabiq scam ka imkaan: {x}%","Khatre ke nishaan","Andar ke links","Kya karein","\u2022 Is mein diye links ya numbers par click/call na karein.\n\u2022 OTP, PIN, CVV ya password kabhi na batayein.\n\u2022 Agar yeh bank ya company hone ka daawa kare to unki official app ya number se rabta karein.\n\u2022 Bhejne wale ko block aur report karein.","Code, PIN ya password maangta hai","Jaldi machata hai ('foran', 'aaj', 'abhi')","Dhamki deta hai (block, band, giraftari)","Inaam ya muft cheezon ka waada","Paise bhejne ya jama karwane ko kehta hai","Login, CNIC ya card ki maloomat maangta hai","Bank, company, afsar ya rishtedar banne ka dikhawa","Code wapas bhejne ko kehta hai \u2014 account churane ki mashhoor chaal!","Khatarnak link hai","AI: maloom scam patterns se milta hai","QR scan karein","Camera QR code ki taraf karein. ShieldPal kuch khulne se pehle batata hai ke yeh kya hai.","Is device par camera scanning nahi. QR ka text paste karein.","Is QR code mein hai","2FA Vault mein add karein","Family mein shamil hon","Website link","Wi-Fi network","Payment ki darkhwast","2FA setup code","ShieldPal family invite","Phone number","Pehle se likha SMS","E-mail","Location","Crypto wallet address","Contact card","Text","Service","Account","Network","Security","Paise jayenge","ID","Raqam","Number","Message","Website ka link. Kholne se pehle check karein.","\u26a0\ufe0f Bina password ka Wi-Fi \u2014 doosre aapka traffic dekh sakte hain.","\u26a0\ufe0f Purani WEP security jo aasani se toot jaati hai.","Password wala Wi-Fi (WPA).","\ud83d\udcb8 Payment QR. Dekh lein naam dukaan se milta ho. Asli QR par nakli stickers aam hain.","Crypto payment wapas nahi hoti. Sirf jaanne walon ko bhejein.","Is number par call karta hai.","Pehle se likha SMS bhejta hai \u2014 premium numbers par paise kat sakte hain.","E-mail likhta hai.","Map par jagah kholta hai.","Contact add karta hai.","Saada text, scam AI ne jaancha.","Kisi account ke 2FA codes set karta hai. Vault mein add karein.","Yeh 2FA QR code kharab hai.","ShieldPal Family Safe-Word circle ka invite.","Yeh family invite theek nahi.","Anjaan number se call ya message aaya? Yahan check karein.","Number check karein","Number ki maloomat","Number","Mulk","Qisam","Network","(asli \u2014 number port ho sakta hai)","Sahi number","Mobile","Landline","Toll-free","Premium-rate (mehenga!)","Internet number (VoIP)","Shared cost","Personal number","Company (UAN)","Sahi number nahi \u2014 nakli ho sakta hai","Premium-rate number: wapas call bohot mehengi pad sakti hai","Internet (VoIP) number \u2014 scammers aasani se bana lete hain","Doosre mulk ka number","Yeh mulk missed-call (wangiri) scam mein aam hai \u2014 wapas call na karein","Short code \u2014 aam taur par company ya bank","Aapne is number ko scam report kiya hai","Kya main dekh sakta hun yeh kiska hai?","Maalik ka naam aur live location private hain. ShieldPal logon ko track nahi karta \u2014 yeh kaam qanooni taur par sirf police aur mobile company kar sakti hai. Agar koi dhamki ya blackmail kare to messages sambhal kar rakhein aur apne mulk ki cyber crime authority (Pakistan mein FIA / NCCIA) ko report karein.","Scam mark karein","Save ho gaya. ShieldPal is number se khabardar karega.","Dekhein password kitna mazboot hai. Yeh aapke phone se bahar nahi jata.","Password likhein","Bohot kamzor","Kamzor","Theek","Mazboot","Bohot mazboot \ud83d\udcaa","Hacker ko guess karne mein lagega: {x}","\u26d4 {x} leak hui password lists mein mila! Kabhi use na karein.","\u2705 Maloom leaks mein nahi mila.","Hacker leaks mein check karein","Sirf password ke fingerprint (hash) ke 5 huroof haveibeenpwned.com ko jaate hain \u2014 password kabhi nahi.","Yeh sab se aam passwords mein se hai","Dohraye gaye huroof (aaa, 111)","Aasan tarteeb (1234, qwerty)","Saal shamil hai \u2014 guess karna aasan","Kam az kam 12 huroof rakhein","! # % jaise nishaan add karein","BARE aur chhote huroof milayein","Yeh password hackers ne leak kiya hai","Password generator","Mazboot random password banayein.","Banayein","Naya password copy ho gaya","Khatarnak link {app}","Scam message {app}","Khatarnak app install hui: {app}","Khatarnak website block hui","Khatarnak QR code","Chat","App","Yeh link na kholein aur jawab na dein. Agar khol kar password likh diya tha to foran woh password badlein aur 2FA on karein.","App hatayein","Nipat gaya","Sab saaf karein","Khatron ki poori history delete karni hai?","Khatre ke alerts","\u26a0\ufe0f {app} mein khatarnak link",'"{chat}" se: {url} \u2014 mat kholna!',"\u26a0\ufe0f {app} mein scam message",'"{chat}" se: yeh scam lagta hai. Jawab na dein, code na batayein.',"\u26a0\ufe0f Khatarnak app install hui",'"{app}" ke paas khatarnak taqat hai. Dekhne ke liye tap karein.',"Khabardar! {pet} ko khatarnak link mila hai. Isay mat kholna!","Khabardar! Yeh message scam lagta hai. Jawab mat dena!","Khabardar! Abhi ek khatarnak app install hui hai.","Shield VPN khatarnak websites block kar raha hai","WhatsApp, SMS, Telegram, Instagram, email waghera ki nayi notifications par nazar rakhta hai. Jaise hi scam message ya khatarnak link aaye, ShieldPal foran khabardar karta hai \u2014 awaaz, bolti warning aur chat ke naam ke saath \u2014 chahe aapne link khola bhi na ho. Sab kuch aapke phone par hi check hota hai.","ShieldPal ko alerts dikhane ki ijazat dein","Alerts","Bolti warning","{pet} warning bol kar sunata hai","Alarm ki awaaz","Khatarnak cheez par oonchi awaaz","Alert test karein","Halka, private VPN jo aapke phone par hi chalta hai. Yeh har app mein maloom malware aur phishing websites ke connection block karta hai (Cloudflare ka malware-block DNS + ShieldPal ki list). Yeh aapka IP address nahi chhupata aur speed kam nahi karta.","Ab tak block hue: {x}","Please VPN connection ki ijazat dein.","Safe Link Gate","ShieldPal ko apna default browser bana lein. Kisi bhi app mein jo link dabayein woh pehle ShieldPal ke paas aayega; mehfooz links foran asli browser mein khulenge, khatarnak ruk jayenge.","Android par maujood hai.","iPhone aur computer par","iOS aur computer apps ko doosri apps ki notifications parhne ya installed apps scan karne nahi dete. Share \u2192 ShieldPal, Link Check, Message Check, Safe QR, Number Check, 2FA Vault aur Family Safe-Word use karein \u2014 yeh har jagah chalte hain.","Yeh kaise kaam karta hai","Scammer ab chhoti video se kisi ki awaaz nakal kar lete hain. Ek circle banayein aur har family member saamne baith kar uska QR scan kare. Phir sab ke phone par wohi 3 emojis dikhenge jo har 5 minute baad badalte hain. Agar koi call kare 'main hun, paise bhejo!', to poochein: \"Hamare emojis batao\". Scammer ko yeh pata nahi ho sakte.","Meri family","Family circle banayein","Invite","{x} mein invite","Family member ShieldPal se isay scan kare (Shield \u2192 Family Safe-Word \u2192 Join). Sirf saamne baith kar dikhayein!","{x} mein shamil ho gaye!","{x} mein badlega","Aapke 2FA codes, is device par encrypted.","2FA kya hai?","Do marhala tasdeeq ek 6 digit code add karti hai jo har 30 second baad badalta hai. Agar hacker password chura bhi le, is code ke baghair login nahi kar sakta. Facebook, Instagram, Gmail, Discord ya game account mein Security \u2192 Two-factor \u2192 Authenticator app kholein aur yahan QR code scan karein.","2FA QR code scan karein","Key khud likhein","Service (jaise Instagram)","Account (jaise aapki email)","Secret key","Yeh secret key sahi nahi.","Code copy ho gaya","Yeh 2FA account delete karna hai?","Pehle us account mein 2FA band kar lein, warna aap account se bahar ho sakte hain.","Scam ya Safe?","Asli jaise messages swipe karein. Waqt se pehle!","Behtareen: {x}/10","\u2190 baayein swipe = SCAM \xb7 daayein swipe = SAFE \u2192","Scam","Safe","Sahi!","Oops!","Yeh SCAM tha.","Yeh SAFE tha.","{x} / {y}","Kamaal! {pet} ko aap par fakhr hai \ud83c\udfc6","Achi koshish! Dobara khelein aur scam expert banein.","Behtareen combo","Dobara khelein","Link official website nahi \u2014 sirf naam ki nakal hai.","Aam raseed: na link, na mutalba, na jaldi.","Asli programs SMS par kabhi OTP ya CNIC nahi maangte.","Asli code message jo kehta hai kisi ko NA batayein. Bas forward na karein.","'Galti se bheja code mujhe wapas bhejo' \u2014 isi tarah WhatsApp aur game accounts churaye jaate hain.","Jaan pehchan wale ka aam message, kuch mashkook nahi.","Naya number + foran paise + 'kisi ko mat batana' = nakli rishtedar scam. Asli insaan ko call karein.","Link ke bajaye official app ke andar dekhne ko kehta hai.","Deadline wali daraoni dhamkiyan aapko ghabrane ke liye hoti hain.","Koi asli site password ke badle muft cheez nahi deti.","Jis muqable mein hissa hi nahi liya usmein jeet nahi sakte \u2014 aur asli inaam par fee nahi lagti.","Asli naukri shuru karne ke liye paise nahi maangti.","Bank kabhi call ya SMS par card ka CVV, PIN ya OTP nahi maangta.","Jaan pehchan wale ka asli Google Maps link.","Anjaan logon ki dosti wali baat aksar account ya crypto scam par khatam hoti hai.","Guaranteed bada munafa hamesha scam hota hai.","Meters aur posters par nakli QR stickers payment ke jaal mein le jaate hain.","Microsoft kabhi call ya pop-up se aapko phone karne nahi kehta.","Mod APKs mein aksar jasoos software hota hai jo account churata hai.","{pet} ki almaari","Pehna hua","Aapka","Aapko {x} aur coins chahiye","Waah! Naya look \ud83d\ude0d","Kaamyabiyan","Kaamyabi mili","Pehla scan","Pehla Deep Scan chalayein","Link jasoos","10 links check karein","Scam buster","5 scams pakdein","Quiz master","30 quiz cards ke sahi jawab","Aag laga di","7 din ki streak","Qila band","100 safety score layein","Double taala","Ek 2FA account add karein","Family hero","Family circle banayein ya join karein","Muhafiz","Live Guard aur Shield VPN on karein","QR ninja","Ek QR code scan karein","Aapke aadaad","Check kiye links","Pakde gaye khatre","Quiz ke sahi jawab","Din ki streak","Hi! Main Pal AI hun \u2728 Online mehfooz rehne ke baare mein kuch bhi poochein, mashkook link ya message paste karein, ya poochein ke ShieldPal kaise kaam karta hai.","Online \xb7 Claude AI","Offline mode","AI settings","Sawal poochein ya link / message paste karein\u2026","soch raha hai\u2026","Online AI tak nahi pahunch saka, is liye offline jawab yeh hai:","Maaf kijiye, is mein madad nahi kar sakta. Main aapke apne accounts aur devices bachane mein madad kar sakta hun.","Hmm, iska jawab nahi mila. Doosre tareeqe se poochein.","\u2705 Is link mein mujhe khatre ke nishaan nahi dikhe.","\u26a0\ufe0f Yeh link mashkook lagta hai:","\u26d4 Yeh link KHATARNAK lagta hai \u2014 mat kholein:","Gehri jaanch (cloud browser + Google) ke liye Link Check use karein.","\u26d4 Yeh message scam lagta hai:","\u26a0\ufe0f Yeh message mashkook lagta hai:","Mera Free Fire account hack ho gaya \ud83d\ude2d","2FA kaise on karun?","Kya OTP batana theek hai?","Live Guard kaise kaam karta hai?","Assalam o Alaikum! \ud83d\udc4b Main aapko mehfooz rakhne ke liye hun. Link paste karein ya kuch bhi poochein.","Koi baat nahi! Mehfooz rahein \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","Afsos hua \ud83d\ude1f Abhi yeh karein:\n1. Us app ka official 'Forgot password' / account recovery page use karein (app khud kholein, messages ke links nahi).\n2. Jin accounts par wohi password tha sab ka password badlein.\n3. 2FA on karein (Vault tab).\n4. Account ki security settings mein baaki saare devices se log out karein.\n5. Deep Scan chalayein taake phone mein koi jasoos app na ho.\n6. Doston ko batayein ke purane account ke messages par bharosa na karein.","Game accounts sab se pehla nishana hain \ud83c\udfae\n\u2022 'Free diamonds / UC / robux' sites HAMESHA nakli hoti hain \u2014 login chura leti hain.\n\u2022 Game account ko 2FA wale Google/Facebook se link karein.\n\u2022 Aane wala login code kabhi kisi ko na dein.\n\u2022 Hack ho gaya? Sirf official in-game support / Garena help center use karein.","OTP, PIN ya verification code kabhi kisi ko na dein \u2014 na bank wale ko, na 'customer care' ko, na doston ko. Jo maange woh aapka account ya paisa chura raha hai.","Link kholne se pehle: asli domain dekhein, ghalat spelling aur .xyz/.top jaise saste endings se bachein, aur chhote links se hoshiyar rahein. Yahan paste karein ya Link Check use karein \u2014 ShieldPal isay mehfooz cloud browser mein bhi khol sakta hai.","2FA = doosra taala. Account ki Security settings \u2192 Two-factor authentication \u2192 Authenticator app mein jayein, phir ShieldPal ke Vault tab mein QR scan karein. Backup codes mehfooz jagah rakhein!","Acha password = lamba (12+), har account ka alag, mile jule huroof. Jumla behtareen hai: 'MeriBilli!3AamKhatiHai'. Password Check se test karein.","Shield VPN aapke phone par chalta hai aur har app mein khatarnak websites block karta hai. Yeh location nahi chhupata \u2014 yeh security filter hai. Shield \u2192 Protection mein on karein.","Deep Scan chalayein: yeh jasoosi taqat wali apps (screen control, SMS parhna, chhupa icon, admin rights) dhoondta hai aur ek tap mein hatane deta hai. Android kisi app ko chupke se doosri app delete nahi karne deta, is liye har removal aap confirm karte hain.","AI ab awaaz nakal kar leta hai. Agar koi 'rishtedar' ghabrahat mein paise maange: call kaat kar unke asli number par wapas call karein, ya Family Safe-Word emojis poochein.","Khula Wi-Fi (bina password) doosron ko jhaankne deta hai. Us par login na karein, ya Shield VPN on karein. Kisi anjaan QR se Wi-Fi connect karne se pehle check karein.","QR codes mein scam links ya payment chhupi ho sakti hai. Safe QR use karein: kuch khulne se pehle andar ka maal dikhata hai.","Number Check number ka mulk, qisam aur network dikhata hai aur premium ya scam patterns par khabardar karta hai. Naam aur live location private hote hain \u2014 koi imaandaar app yeh nahi dikha sakti.","{pet} ki sehat = aapke phone ki hifazat. Deep Scan ke masle theek karein, Live Guard aur Shield VPN on karein, 2FA add karein aur roz check-in karein taake {pet} khush rahe. Coins kama kar kapde khareedein!","Live Guard aapke phone par nayi notifications (WhatsApp, SMS waghera) parhta hai aur scam ya khatarnak link aate hi app aur chat ke naam ke saath khabardar karta hai. Shield \u2192 Protection mein on karein.","Iske baare mein abhi pakka nahi pata \ud83e\udd14 Links, scams, hack accounts, 2FA, passwords, VPN ya Wi-Fi ke baare mein poochein \u2014 ya mashkook message paste karein. Zyada samajhdar jawab ke liye Settings \u2192 API keys mein Claude AI connect karein.","Zabaan","Apni zabaan chunein","Pet ka naam","ShieldPal kholte waqt PIN / fingerprint maange","Fingerprint / chehra use karein","PIN chunein (4-8 digits)","PIN dobara likhein","PIN","PIN kam az kam 4 digits ka ho","PIN nahi mile","ShieldPal locked hai","Ghalat PIN","Kholein","ShieldPal kholein","Online services aur AI",u.A,"ShieldPal offline kaam karta hai. Yeh muft/ikhtiyari keys extra taqat deti hain. Yeh sirf is device par encrypted rehti hain.","Pal AI ko samajhdar banata hai (har zabaan). Key console.anthropic.com se lein.","Online AI use karein","Links ko Google ki khatarnak sites ki list se milata hai. Muft key: Google Cloud Console \u2192 Safe Browsing API.","Links ko door ke sandbox browser mein khol kar screenshot deta hai. Muft key urlscan.io par.","Privacy","ShieldPal aapke data ke saath kya karta hai","\u2022 Messages aur notifications aapke phone par check hote hain. Kabhi upload nahi hote.\n\u2022 Links Google Safe Browsing ya urlscan.io ko sirf tab jaate hain jab aapne woh keys daali hon.\n\u2022 Pal AI online aapki chat Anthropic ko sirf tab bhejta hai jab Claude key daali ho.\n\u2022 Password leak check sirf hash ke 5 huroof bhejta hai.\n\u2022 2FA secrets, PIN aur keys device par encrypted hain.\n\u2022 Na ads, na tracking, na data ki farokht.","Aapka pyaara cyber muhafiz \ud83d\udc3e","Aapka pyaara cyber muhafiz \ud83d\udc3e","Apne muhafiz se milein!","Jab aapka phone mehfooz ho yeh tandurust rehta hai \u2014 aur hackers paas aayein to beemar ho jata hai. Iska naam rakhein!","Super powers","Live Guard: WhatsApp ya SMS mein scam link aate hi khabardar karta hai \u2014 kholne se bhi pehle","Link Check: links ko mehfooz cloud browser mein kholta hai, aapke phone par kabhi nahi","Deep Scan: jasoos apps, kamzor lock aur khatarnak settings dhoondta hai \u2014 ek tap mein hatayein","Shield VPN: har app mein khatarnak websites block karta hai","2FA Vault aur Family Safe-Word: accounts lock karein aur AI awaaz scam rokein","Scam ya Safe? game, coins, kapde aur kaamyabiyan","Pal AI: apni zabaan mein kuch bhi poochein","Live Guard on karein","Aapke messages isi phone par check hote hain aur kabhi upload nahi hote.","Chalo shuru karein!"],t.w)
