B.uN=new A.a3(B.LK,["Use the free online AI?","Pal AI can chat about anything, like ChatGPT, in your own language. For that, your chat messages are sent over the internet to a free AI service (pollinations.ai). Do not type passwords or codes. You can switch it off any time in Settings. Say No to stay fully offline.","Yes, use it","No, stay offline","Online \xb7 Claude","Online \xb7 Free AI","New chat","Someone asked me for my OTP","My Free Fire account got hacked","Tell me a cyber tip","What is phishing?","I'm doing great, thanks for asking! \ud83d\ude0a I'm Pal AI, {pet}'s friend. I'm here to keep you safe. Ask me about scams, hacked accounts, links, or just chat!",'I\'m Pal AI, the assistant inside ShieldPal \ud83d\udc3e\n\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd17 Paste a link and I check it\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcac Paste a message and I tell you if it is a scam\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd10 I help you recover hacked accounts\n\u2022 \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f I explain scams, passwords, 2FA, VPN and privacy\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf0d I answer in the language you write in\n\nTurn on "Free online AI" in Settings \u2192 Online services & AI and I can also answer general questions like ChatGPT.',"Why did the phone go to therapy? It had too many unresolved notifications. \ud83d\ude04",'My password is "incorrect". So when I forget it, the app tells me: "Your password is incorrect." \ud83d\ude0e',"A hacker walks into a cafe and orders a byte. \ud83d\ude02 Stay safe, friend!",'Why was the scam link so confident? Because it kept saying "Trust me, click here!" \ud83d\ude43 Don\'t.','Wi-Fi: "I\'m free!" Hacker: "So am I, let me join." \ud83d\ude05 Avoid open Wi-Fi.','Common scams to watch for:\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Free diamonds / robux / UC links\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd22 "Send me the code you received" (OTP scam)\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfe6 Fake bank, Easypaisa, JazzCash or NADRA messages\n\u2022 \ud83d\udce6 Fake parcel / customs fee messages\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcbc Jobs that ask for a registration fee\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf81 Prize or lottery you never entered\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc98 Romance and investment (crypto) scams\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 "Mom, I have a new number, send money"\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcde Fake tech support ("your phone has a virus")\n\nRule: real companies never ask for OTPs, PINs or passwords, and never rush you.','Payment safety:\n\u2022 Never share OTP, PIN or CVV, not even with "bank staff".\n\u2022 Easypaisa / JazzCash / UPI: only PAY when YOU want to pay. "Receiving" money never needs your PIN.\n\u2022 If someone says they sent money by mistake, check your balance in the official app, never through a link.\n\u2022 Install banking apps only from Google Play and check the developer name.\n\u2022 Hang up and call the number printed on your card.\nIf you already sent money: call your bank / wallet helpline immediately and report it.','SIM and CNIC safety:\n\u2022 No one from PTA or a telecom company blocks your SIM by SMS or asks for your CNIC on a call.\n\u2022 Never share CNIC pictures or biometric details with strangers.\n\u2022 Check how many SIMs are registered on your CNIC through your operator\'s official channel and close ones you do not use.\n\u2022 Sudden "No service" on your SIM may mean a SIM swap: contact your operator right away.','Phishing means a fake message, page or call that pretends to be a real company so you give away your password, OTP or money.\n\nSigns: urgency ("within 1 hour!"), a strange web address (garena-event.xyz instead of garena.com), spelling mistakes, requests for a login or code, prizes you never entered.\nWhat to do: do not click, paste the link into ShieldPal\'s Link Check, and delete the message.','Social media safety:\n\u2022 Turn on 2FA for Instagram, Facebook, TikTok and Snapchat.\n\u2022 Make your profile private and accept only people you know.\n\u2022 Do not post your phone number, school, address or live location.\n\u2022 Ignore "copyright violation" and "verify your page" messages with links.\n\u2022 Use Settings \u2192 Security \u2192 Login activity to see where you are logged in.',"Tips for kids, teens and parents:\n\u2022 Talk openly: tell your child they will never be in trouble for showing a strange message.\n\u2022 Never meet or send photos to people you only know online.\n\u2022 Never share passwords, even with friends.\n\u2022 Use the Family Safe-Word in ShieldPal so voice or message tricks do not work.\n\u2022 If someone threatens or blackmails you, do not pay. Save proof and tell a trusted adult.","If your phone is lost or stolen:\n1. Use Find My Device (google.com/android/find) to ring, lock or erase it.\n2. Call your operator to block the SIM.\n3. Change the passwords of Google, WhatsApp, Instagram and banking apps from another device.\n4. Log out of WhatsApp Web / Telegram sessions.\n5. Report it to the police. Next time: enable a PIN or fingerprint and Find My Device in advance.","App permissions:\n\u2022 A flashlight or wallpaper app does not need your contacts, microphone or SMS.\n\u2022 Apps with Accessibility or Device Admin access can control your phone, so give it only to apps you really trust.\n\u2022 Check Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 Permission manager, and ShieldPal's Deep Scan shows risky apps with a Remove button.","Back up your photos and chats regularly (Google Photos / Google Drive, WhatsApp chat backup). If your phone is lost, broken or locked by ransomware you still keep everything. Keep the backup account protected with 2FA.","If someone is blackmailing or threatening you (for example with photos or chats):\n1. Do NOT pay and do not send more pictures. Payment never ends it.\n2. Do not delete anything: take screenshots and save usernames, numbers and links.\n3. Block them and report their account on the platform.\n4. Tell a trusted adult or friend. You are not at fault.\n5. Report it to the cybercrime authority: in Pakistan the FIA Cyber Crime Wing (helpline 1991 / nr3c.gov.pk), in India cybercrime.gov.in (1930).\nYou are not alone, and this is a crime against you, not something to be ashamed of.",'Online shopping safety (OLX, Daraz, Facebook sellers):\n\u2022 Do not pay in advance to people you have not met. Prefer cash on delivery or meeting in a public place.\n\u2022 Check the seller\'s reviews and age of the account. Deals far below market price are usually fake.\n\u2022 A "buyer" who wants to send you a code or QR to "receive" money is scamming you: you never need to scan or enter a PIN to get paid.\n\u2022 Do not move the chat to a link someone sends.','Investment and crypto safety:\n\u2022 Guaranteed profit does not exist. "Double your money in 7 days" is a scam.\n\u2022 Never connect your wallet to a link from a message or an airdrop.\n\u2022 Check that the website address is the real exchange (binance.com), not a look-alike.\n\u2022 Never share your recovery phrase with anyone, ever.\n\u2022 Do not invest because a stranger who "made lots of money" is guiding you.','Job scam warning signs:\n\u2022 You must pay a "registration", "training" or "visa" fee first.\n\u2022 Earn thousands a day just by liking videos or typing.\n\u2022 The recruiter only uses WhatsApp and no company e-mail or office.\n\u2022 They ask for passport, CNIC or bank details before hiring you.\nReal employers never charge you to give you a job.',"Keep your phone updated: Settings \u2192 System \u2192 Software update. Updates fix security holes that hackers use. Also update your apps in Google Play and turn on auto-update.","Where to report:\n\u2022 Pakistan: FIA Cyber Crime Wing, helpline 1991, nr3c.gov.pk; PTA complaints 0800-55055.\n\u2022 India: cybercrime.gov.in or helpline 1930.\n\u2022 Elsewhere: your national cybercrime authority or local police.\nAlso report the account or number to the platform (WhatsApp, Instagram...) and, if you lost money, to your bank or wallet immediately. Save screenshots as evidence.","A data breach means a company's data was stolen and your e-mail or password may be in it. Check a password in ShieldPal's Password Check (it uses Have I Been Pwned safely, only 5 characters of a fingerprint leave your phone). If it was leaked, change it everywhere you used it and turn on 2FA.","Quick guide to ShieldPal:\n\u2022 \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Deep Scan (Shield tab): checks your phone's security and risky apps.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Live Guard: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 turn on notification access, then scam links in WhatsApp/SMS notifications raise an alarm.\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf10 Shield VPN: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 turn on to block dangerous websites; pick a DNS server there.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd17 Link Check, \ud83d\udcac Message Check, \ud83d\udcf7 Safe QR, \ud83d\udcde Number Check are in the Shield tab.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd11 2FA Vault and Family Safe-Word are in the Vault tab.","Bye for now! Stay safe out there. \ud83d\udc3e\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","I'm not sure about that one yet. \ud83e\udd14 Here is what I can do offline: check a link or a message (paste it here), explain scams, OTPs, passwords, hacked accounts, VPN, QR codes, payments, kids' safety and blackmail.\n\nFor any other topic, turn on \"Free online AI\" in Settings \u2192 Online services & AI, then I can chat about anything.","Someone is asking you to hand over a code, PIN or password. Real companies never do.",'"New number, send money" is a classic family-impersonation trick.',"\ud83d\udd52 It is {x} on your phone right now.","\ud83d\udcc5 Today is {x}.","ShieldPal is a free cyber-safety app with a cute guardian pet \ud83d\udc3e\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\n\n\u2022 Live Guard catches scam links and messages in WhatsApp / SMS notifications\n\u2022 Deep Scan checks your phone's security and risky apps\n\u2022 Link Check, Message Check and Safe QR (with cloud second opinions)\n\u2022 Number Check, Password Check, 2FA Vault, Family Safe-Word\n\u2022 Shield VPN blocks dangerous websites\n\u2022 A pet that gets sick when your phone is unsafe, a game, coins and 14 languages\n\nNo account, no ads, no tracking.","ShieldPal is free: no ads, no subscription, no hidden charges. Only the optional Claude AI key is paid, and you pay Anthropic directly if you choose to use it.","ShieldPal is made by Faraz Labs (Usman Faraz). You can send feedback from Settings \u2192 Send feedback.",'Your data stays on your phone. ShieldPal has no account and no server. Messages, notifications and app lists are checked on the device and never uploaded. Only the optional online checks send small pieces (for example a website name to Cloudflare). See Settings \u2192 Privacy Policy and Data safety, and you can erase everything with "Delete all my data".',"Shield VPN is a local VPN on your phone. It forwards your traffic normally, blocks dangerous websites by DNS, speeds up lookups with a cache and lets you pick the DNS server (Settings \u2192 Protection).\n\nIt does NOT hide your IP or change your country. So a website that your internet provider or government blocks at network level cannot be opened by it, and no DNS change can fix that. That needs a remote VPN server in another country. ShieldPal can run your own WireGuard config for that (Protection \u2192 Remote VPN).",'Sorry about that! Quick fixes:\n\u2022 Update to the latest ShieldPal and keep the app in Android\'s "unrestricted battery" mode (Settings \u2192 Apps \u2192 ShieldPal \u2192 Battery) so the phone does not close it.\n\u2022 VPN: turn it off and on, and test it in Protection \u2192 Test connection.\n\u2022 Live Guard: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 allow notification access.\nIf it still fails, tell me exactly what you see or send feedback from Settings.',"Honest answer: ShieldPal cannot show who a SIM is registered to. That is private data held by the mobile operator, and only the operator and police can look it up. What it CAN show: country, number type, original network, warning signs (wangiri / premium / VoIP), the name saved in your own contacts, and your own scam marks. The Google / Truecaller buttons open public caller-ID sites whose names come from other users, so they can be wrong.","You can change the language any time in Settings \u2192 Language. I also answer in the language you write in, for example Roman Urdu, Urdu, Hindi or English.","I'm a brand new AI, so I'm too young to count \ud83d\ude04 but I'm always ready to keep you safe!","Aww, thank you! \ud83e\udd70 I care about keeping you safe too. Stay careful out there.","I'm sorry you feel like this. \ud83d\udc99 Talking to a trusted friend or family member can really help. If something online is hurting you (bullying, threats), save the proof, do not reply, and tell an adult you trust. I'm here if you want to chat.",'Bored? Try the "Scam or Safe?" game in the Play tab. It is endless and you earn coins for your pet! \ud83c\udfae',"Hello! \ud83c\udf1f Hope your day is going well. How can I help you stay safe?","Nice to meet you! \ud83d\ude0a How can I help you today?",'I can\'t see live weather offline. \ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Turn on "Free online AI" in Settings \u2192 Online services & AI and I can help with more topics.',"Cloud reputation (Cloudflare)","Cloudflare's security filter BLOCKS this site as malware or phishing. Do not open it.","Not on Cloudflare's malware / phishing block list.","Could not run this check (no internet, or it is switched off in Settings \u2192 Online services).","Not set up. It needs a free Google key: Settings \u2192 Online services & AI. Cloudflare's check above already works without any key.","Open link","Progress","Unlocked!","Reward","All your data was deleted from this phone.","Send feedback","Tell us what to improve or report a problem","Made with care by {x}","Cloud security filters (Cloudflare / Google) list a link in this message as dangerous.","Cloud security filters (Cloudflare / Google) list this website as dangerous. Do not open it.","Remote VPN (WireGuard)","Sends ALL your traffic through a server you choose in another country. Your IP and country change, and sites that your provider blocks open.","Free way: create a free ProtonVPN account \u2192 Downloads \u2192 WireGuard configuration \u2192 pick a Free server \u2192 Create \u2192 copy the text and paste it here. Any WireGuard config works.","Paste WireGuard config","That does not look like a WireGuard config","Config saved on this phone (encrypted)","Remove config","Connect","Disconnect","Check my IP","Your IP","Could not connect","While the Remote VPN is on, Shield's local filter is paused (Android runs one VPN at a time).","Teach ShieldPal","Was the result wrong? Tell the on-device AI what this message really is. It learns on your phone and gets smarter for you.","It IS a scam","It is safe","Thanks! ShieldPal learned from this.","Messages you taught so far: {x}","Cyber tips","All tips","+{x} \ud83e\ude99 for reading today's tip","Read today","More tips","All","Links","Messages","Apps","Websites","QR","{x} caught \xb7 {y} need attention","Mark all handled","All marked as handled","Cyber tip of the day","Press back again to exit",'You marked this number as a scam, so ShieldPal shows it as dangerous. Tap "Remove my scam mark" if that was a mistake.',"No warning signs found for this number.","{x} warning sign(s) found, see the red flags below.","Saved as","Not in your contacts","Show the name from your contacts?","ShieldPal can look up the name you saved for this number. It happens on your phone only and contacts are never uploaded.","These open a public website in your browser. They are not run by ShieldPal and results may be wrong. The real owner of a SIM is private, only the operator and police can trace it.","Remove my scam mark","Online services & AI","Free AI, link checks, keys, and what is sent","ShieldPal works fully offline. These optional online services make it smarter. Each card says what it does and exactly what is sent. Nothing is sent unless you use that feature. Tap Test to see that it really works.","Sent","Test","Get a free key","Needs key","Add a key first","Works!","Did not work (check internet)","Key rejected or no internet","Connected, but the test site was not flagged","Free online AI","Makes Pal AI chat about anything in your language, like ChatGPT. No key and no account needed.","your chat messages (never passwords or codes)","Use the free online AI","Use Claude by Anthropic for the best answers. You need your own API key (paid by you).","your chat messages, with your key","Asks Cloudflare's security DNS if a link's website is known malware or phishing. Works with no key.","only the website name (like example.com), not the full link","Check links with Cloudflare","Google's list of dangerous sites. A second opinion on every link you check.","the link address",'How to get the key (free): open Google Cloud Console, create a project, enable "Safe Browsing API", then Credentials \u2192 Create API key. Paste it here.',"Opens the link in a safe cloud browser far from your phone and shows a screenshot. Needs a free urlscan.io account key.","the link address (scan is kept unlisted)","Password Check asks Have I Been Pwned if a password was in a leak. Works with no key.","only the first 5 characters of the password's fingerprint","Privacy Policy","Last updated","Open web version","Data safety","What is collected, shared and kept","A simple summary, the same answers we give to Google Play. The full details are in the Privacy Policy.","No data collected by us","ShieldPal has no account and no servers. We do not collect your name, e-mail, phone number, location or contacts.","Checked on your phone","Messages, notifications, app list, Deep Scan, Number Check, QR codes and the scam AI model all run on the device and are never uploaded.","Encrypted storage","2FA secrets, keys and your PIN are encrypted with the Android Keystore. Online requests use HTTPS.","You can delete everything",'Use "Delete all my data" below, or uninstall the app. Nothing is kept on a server.',"No ads, no tracking, no selling","ShieldPal has no ads and no analytics, and never sells or shares your data.","Optional: only when you use the feature","Link Check","The website name goes to Cloudflare. The full link goes to Google Safe Browsing or urlscan.io only if you add your own key.","Password Check","Only 5 characters of a hash go to Have I Been Pwned. Never the password.","Pal AI","Offline by default. If you turn on Free online AI (or add a Claude key), your chat text is sent to that service.","Shield VPN","A local VPN on your phone. No traffic goes to ShieldPal. DNS lookups go to the DNS server you choose (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9...).","Delete all my data","Erase settings, threat log, 2FA codes, keys and pet progress from this phone","This permanently erases everything ShieldPal stored on this phone, including your 2FA codes and PIN. It cannot be undone.","DNS server","Server changed to {x}","Test connection","Test internet","Timed out","Blocked","Failed","Malware test site (should be blocked)","Shield VPN is a local DNS shield: it blocks dangerous websites and changes which DNS server your phone uses, which also opens sites that your provider blocks only at DNS level. It does not hide your IP address or change your country, because that needs a remote VPN server.","Cloudflare Security","Blocks malware and phishing (recommended)","Cloudflare Family","Blocks malware, phishing and adult sites","Cloudflare Fast","Fastest, no filtering. Good for blocked sites","Google DNS","Reliable, no filtering","Quad9","Blocks malware, privacy-focused","AdGuard","Blocks ads and trackers","OpenDNS","Stable, optional filtering","Choose your pet","Cat","Bunny","Bear","Puppy","Fox","Pet voice","Girl, boy or cute voice, speed and speaker","Choose how {pet} speaks the warnings. Tap a style to hear it.","Hi! I am {pet}. I will warn you when a scam link comes. Stay safe!","Girl","Cute pet","Normal","Boy","Deep","Fine tune","Tone","Speed","Voices on this phone","Phone default","No extra voices found for this language. You can install more in Android Settings \u2192 Text-to-speech."],t.w)
B.apw=new A.a3(B.LK,["Free online AI istemal karein?","Pal AI ChatGPT ki tarah aapki zaban mein har cheez par baat kar sakta hai. Iske liye aapke chat messages internet par ek free AI service (pollinations.ai) ko jate hain. Password ya code mat likhein. Settings mein kabhi bhi band kar sakte hain. Poori tarah offline rehna ho to No dabayein.","Haan, istemal karein","Nahi, offline rahein","Online \xb7 Claude","Online \xb7 Free AI","Nayi chat","Kisi ne mujh se OTP manga","Mera Free Fire account hack ho gaya","Koi cyber tip batao","Phishing kya hai?","Main bilkul theek hoon, shukriya! \ud83d\ude0a Main Pal AI hoon, {pet} ka dost. Main aapko mehfooz rakhne ke liye yahan hoon. Scams, hack account, links ke baare mein poochein ya bas gup shup karein!",'Main Pal AI hoon, ShieldPal ka assistant \ud83d\udc3e\n\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd17 Link paste karein, main check karunga\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcac Message paste karein, main batata hoon scam hai ya nahi\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd10 Hack account wapas lene mein madad\n\u2022 \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Scams, passwords, 2FA, VPN aur privacy samjhata hoon\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf0d Jis zaban mein likhein usi mein jawab deta hoon\n\nSettings \u2192 Online services & AI mein "Free online AI" on karein to main ChatGPT ki tarah har topic par bhi jawab de sakta hoon.',"Phone therapist ke paas kyun gaya? Uski bohat si notifications unread thi. \ud83d\ude04",'Mera password "galat" hai. Jab bhoolta hoon to app kehti hai: "Aap ka password galat hai." \ud83d\ude0e',"Hacker caf\xe9 mein gaya aur bola ek byte dena. \ud83d\ude02 Mehfooz rahein dost!",'Scam link itna confident kyun tha? Kyunke kehta tha "Mujh par bharosa karo, yahan click karo!" \ud83d\ude43 Mat karna.','Wi-Fi: "Main free hoon!" Hacker: "Main bhi, mujhe bhi join karne do." \ud83d\ude05 Open Wi-Fi se bachein.','Aam scams jin se bachna hai:\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Free diamonds / robux / UC ke links\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd22 "Jo code aaya hai woh bhej do" (OTP scam)\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfe6 Nakli bank, Easypaisa, JazzCash ya NADRA ke messages\n\u2022 \ud83d\udce6 Nakli parcel / customs fee ke messages\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcbc Jo job pehle registration fee mange\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf81 Woh inaam jis ke liye aapne kabhi enter nahi kiya\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc98 Romance aur investment (crypto) scams\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 "Ammi mera naya number hai, paise bhejo"\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcde Nakli tech support ("aap ke phone mein virus hai")\n\nUsool: asli company kabhi OTP, PIN ya password nahi mangti aur kabhi jaldi nahi machati.','Payment ki hifazat:\n\u2022 OTP, PIN ya CVV kisi ko na dein, "bank staff" ko bhi nahi.\n\u2022 Easypaisa / JazzCash / UPI: sirf tab PAY karein jab aap khud dena chahte hon. Paise "receive" karne ke liye kabhi PIN nahi chahiye.\n\u2022 Koi kahe ke galti se paise bhej diye to balance official app mein dekhein, kisi link se nahi.\n\u2022 Banking apps sirf Google Play se install karein aur developer ka naam dekhein.\n\u2022 Phone band karke card par likhe number par khud call karein.\nAgar paise bhej chuke hon: fauran bank / wallet helpline ko call karein aur report karein.','SIM aur CNIC ki hifazat:\n\u2022 PTA ya telecom company se koi SMS ya call par SIM block karne ya CNIC mangne nahi aata.\n\u2022 CNIC ki tasveer ya biometric ajnabi ko na dein.\n\u2022 Apne operator ke official zariye se dekhein ke aapke CNIC par kitni SIMs hain aur jo istemal nahi hoti band karwayein.\n\u2022 Achanak SIM par "No service" aaye to SIM swap ho sakta hai: fauran operator se rabta karein.','Phishing ka matlab hai nakli message, page ya call jo asli company ban kar aap se password, OTP ya paise nikalwata hai.\n\nNishaniyan: jaldi ka dabao ("1 ghante mein!"), ajeeb web address (garena.com ki jagah garena-event.xyz), spelling ki ghaltiyan, login ya code ka mutalba, woh inaam jis ke liye aapne kabhi enter nahi kiya.\nKya karein: click na karein, link ShieldPal ke Link Check mein paste karein aur message delete kar dein.','Social media ki hifazat:\n\u2022 Instagram, Facebook, TikTok aur Snapchat par 2FA lagayein.\n\u2022 Profile private rakhein aur sirf jaanne walon ko accept karein.\n\u2022 Phone number, school, address ya live location post na karein.\n\u2022 "Copyright violation" aur "page verify karein" wale link messages ko ignore karein.\n\u2022 Settings \u2192 Security \u2192 Login activity mein dekhein aap kahan kahan login hain.',"Bachon, teenagers aur walidain ke liye:\n\u2022 Khul kar baat karein: bachay ko batayein ke ajeeb message dikhane par usay kabhi daant nahi padegi.\n\u2022 Jin se sirf online mile hon unse kabhi na milein na tasveerein bhejein.\n\u2022 Password kisi ko na dein, doston ko bhi nahi.\n\u2022 ShieldPal ka Family Safe-Word istemal karein taake awaaz ya message ki chaal na chale.\n\u2022 Agar koi dhamki de ya blackmail kare to paise na dein. Saboot save karein aur kisi qabil-e-aitmaad bade ko batayein.","Phone kho jaye ya chori ho to:\n1. Find My Device (google.com/android/find) se ring, lock ya erase karein.\n2. Operator ko call karke SIM block karwayein.\n3. Dusre device se Google, WhatsApp, Instagram aur banking apps ke passwords badlein.\n4. WhatsApp Web / Telegram sessions logout karein.\n5. Police ko report karein. Agli baar: pehle se PIN ya fingerprint aur Find My Device on rakhein.","App permissions:\n\u2022 Torch ya wallpaper app ko contacts, mic ya SMS nahi chahiye.\n\u2022 Accessibility ya Device Admin access wali apps phone control kar sakti hain, sirf unhein dein jin par poora bharosa ho.\n\u2022 Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 Permission manager dekhein, aur ShieldPal ka Deep Scan khatarnak apps Remove button ke saath dikhata hai.","Photos aur chats ka backup lete rahein (Google Photos / Google Drive, WhatsApp chat backup). Phone kho jaye, toot jaye ya ransomware lock kar de to sab kuch mehfooz rahe. Backup account par 2FA lagayein.","Agar koi aapko blackmail ya dhamki de raha hai (jaise tasveeron ya chats se):\n1. Paise NA dein aur mazeed tasveerein na bhejein. Paise dene se yeh khatam nahi hota.\n2. Kuch delete na karein: screenshots lein aur username, number, links save karein.\n3. Usay block karein aur platform par account report karein.\n4. Kisi qabil-e-aitmaad bade ya dost ko batayein. Ismein aapki ghalti nahi.\n5. Cybercrime authority ko report karein: Pakistan mein FIA Cyber Crime Wing (helpline 1991 / nr3c.gov.pk), India mein cybercrime.gov.in (1930).\nAap akele nahi hain, yeh aap ke khilaf jurm hai, sharminda hone ki baat nahi.",'Online shopping ki hifazat (OLX, Daraz, Facebook sellers):\n\u2022 Jin se mile nahi unhein advance payment na dein. Cash on delivery ya public jagah par milna behtar hai.\n\u2022 Seller ke reviews aur account ki umar dekhein. Market se bohat sasta maal aksar nakli hota hai.\n\u2022 Jo "buyer" paise bhejne ke liye code ya QR bheje woh scam hai: paise lene ke liye kabhi scan ya PIN nahi chahiye.\n\u2022 Kisi ke bheje link par chat shift na karein.','Investment aur crypto ki hifazat:\n\u2022 Guaranteed profit nahi hota. "7 din mein paise double" scam hai.\n\u2022 Message ya airdrop ke link se kabhi apna wallet connect na karein.\n\u2022 Dekhein ke website asli exchange (binance.com) ki hai, milti julti nahi.\n\u2022 Recovery phrase kisi ko kabhi na dein.\n\u2022 Is liye invest na karein ke ajnabi jo "bohat kama chuka" hai rehnumai kar raha hai.','Job scam ki nishaniyan:\n\u2022 Pehle "registration", "training" ya "visa" fee dena parta hai.\n\u2022 Sirf videos like karne ya typing se rozana hazaron kamane ka wada.\n\u2022 Recruiter sirf WhatsApp istemal karta hai, company email ya office nahi.\n\u2022 Hire karne se pehle passport, CNIC ya bank details mangta hai.\nAsli employer job dene ke liye kabhi paise nahi mangta.',"Phone update rakhein: Settings \u2192 System \u2192 Software update. Updates woh security surakhein band karti hain jo hackers istemal karte hain. Google Play mein apps bhi update karein aur auto-update on rakhein.","Kahan report karein:\n\u2022 Pakistan: FIA Cyber Crime Wing, helpline 1991, nr3c.gov.pk; PTA shikayat 0800-55055.\n\u2022 India: cybercrime.gov.in ya helpline 1930.\n\u2022 Doosre mulk: apni national cybercrime authority ya local police.\nSaath hi account ya number ko platform (WhatsApp, Instagram...) par report karein aur agar paise gaye hon to fauran bank ya wallet ko batayein. Saboot ke taur par screenshots save rakhein.","Data breach ka matlab hai kisi company ka data chori hua aur aapki email ya password us mein ho sakta hai. ShieldPal ke Password Check mein password check karein (yeh Have I Been Pwned ko mehfooz tareeqe se istemal karta hai, fingerprint ke sirf 5 huroof jate hain). Agar leak nikle to jahan jahan istemal kiya wahan badlein aur 2FA lagayein.","ShieldPal ki mukhtasir guide:\n\u2022 \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Deep Scan (Shield tab): phone ki security aur khatarnak apps check karta hai.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Live Guard: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 notification access on karein, phir WhatsApp/SMS ke scam links par alarm bajta hai.\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf10 Shield VPN: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 on karein, khatarnak websites band ho jati hain; wahin DNS server chunein.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd17 Link Check, \ud83d\udcac Message Check, \ud83d\udcf7 Safe QR, \ud83d\udcde Number Check Shield tab mein hain.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd11 2FA Vault aur Family Safe-Word Vault tab mein hain.","Chalo phir milte hain! Mehfooz rahein. \ud83d\udc3e\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f",'Is ke baare mein abhi mujhe yaqeen nahi. \ud83e\udd14 Offline main yeh kar sakta hoon: link ya message check karna (yahan paste karein), scams, OTP, passwords, hack account, VPN, QR, payments, bachon ki hifazat aur blackmail samjhana.\n\nKisi bhi aur topic ke liye Settings \u2192 Online services & AI mein "Free online AI" on karein, phir main har cheez par baat kar sakta hoon.',"Koi aap se code, PIN ya password maang raha hai. Asli companies kabhi aisa nahi karti.",'"Naya number hai, paise bhejo" ghar walon ki nakal ka purana tareeqa hai.',"\ud83d\udd52 Aap ke phone par abhi {x} baj rahe hain.","\ud83d\udcc5 Aaj {x} hai.","ShieldPal ek free cyber-safety app hai jis mein ek pyaara guardian pet hai \ud83d\udc3e\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\n\n\u2022 Live Guard WhatsApp / SMS notifications ke scam links aur messages pakadta hai\n\u2022 Deep Scan phone ki security aur khatarnak apps check karta hai\n\u2022 Link Check, Message Check aur Safe QR (cloud ki doosri raye ke saath)\n\u2022 Number Check, Password Check, 2FA Vault, Family Safe-Word\n\u2022 Shield VPN khatarnak websites band karta hai\n\u2022 Pet jo phone ke asurakshit hone par beemar hota hai, game, coins aur 14 zabanein\n\nNa account, na ads, na tracking.","ShieldPal bilkul free hai: na ads, na subscription, na chhupe charges. Sirf optional Claude AI key paid hai, jis ke paise aap seedha Anthropic ko dete hain agar istemal karein.","ShieldPal Faraz Labs (Usman Faraz) ne banaya hai. Feedback Settings \u2192 Feedback bhejein se bhej sakte hain.",'Aapka data aapke phone par rehta hai. ShieldPal mein na account hai na server. Messages, notifications aur apps ki list device par check hoti hain aur upload nahi hoti. Sirf optional online checks chhoti si cheez bhejte hain (jaise website ka naam Cloudflare ko). Settings \u2192 Privacy Policy aur Data safety dekhein, aur "Mera sab data delete karein" se sab mita sakte hain.',"Shield VPN phone par local VPN hai. Yeh aapka traffic normal tareeqe se aage bhejta hai, khatarnak websites DNS se block karta hai, cache se lookups tez karta hai aur DNS server chunne deta hai (Settings \u2192 Protection).\n\nYeh aapka IP nahi chhupata aur mulk nahi badalta. Is liye jo website aapka internet provider ya hukumat network level par band kare woh isse nahi khulegi, aur koi DNS tabdeeli bhi isay theek nahi kar sakti. Uske liye dusre mulk ka remote VPN server chahiye. ShieldPal uske liye aapki apni WireGuard config chala sakta hai (Protection \u2192 Remote VPN).",'Maazrat! Fori hal:\n\u2022 ShieldPal ka naya version lagayein aur app ko Android ke "unrestricted battery" mode mein rakhein (Settings \u2192 Apps \u2192 ShieldPal \u2192 Battery) taake phone usay band na kare.\n\u2022 VPN: off karke on karein aur Protection \u2192 Test connection chalayein.\n\u2022 Live Guard: Settings \u2192 Protection \u2192 notification access dein.\nAgar phir bhi na chale to mujhe theek batayein kya dikh raha hai ya Settings se feedback bhejein.',"Seedhi baat: ShieldPal yeh nahi bata sakta ke SIM kis ke naam par registered hai. Yeh mobile operator ke paas private data hota hai aur sirf operator aur police nikal sakti hain. Jo yeh DIKHA sakta hai: mulk, number ki qisam, asli network, khatre ki nishaniyan (wangiri / premium / VoIP), aapke apne contacts mein save naam, aur aapki apni scam marks. Google / Truecaller buttons public caller-ID sites kholte hain jin ke naam doosre users se aate hain, is liye ghalat ho sakte hain.","Zaban kabhi bhi Settings \u2192 Language mein badal sakte hain. Main bhi usi zaban mein jawab deta hoon jis mein aap likhein, jaise Roman Urdu, Urdu, Hindi ya English.","Main bilkul naya AI hoon, is liye umar ginne ke liye bohat chhota \ud83d\ude04 lekin aapko mehfooz rakhne ke liye hamesha tayyar!","Aww, shukriya! \ud83e\udd70 Mujhe bhi aapki hifazat ka khayal hai. Ehtiyaat se rahein.","Mujhe afsos hai ke aap aisa mehsoos kar rahe hain. \ud83d\udc99 Kisi qabil-e-aitmaad dost ya ghar wale se baat karna bohat madadgar hota hai. Agar online koi cheez takleef de rahi hai (bullying, dhamki), saboot save karein, jawab na dein aur kisi bharose ke bade ko batayein. Agar baat karna chahein to main yahan hoon.",'Bore ho rahe hain? Play tab mein "Scam or Safe?" game khelein. Yeh kabhi khatam nahi hota aur pet ke liye coins milte hain! \ud83c\udfae',"Hello! \ud83c\udf1f Umeed hai aap ka din achha guzar raha hai. Main aapko mehfooz rakhne mein kaise madad karun?","Aap se mil kar khushi hui! \ud83d\ude0a Aaj main aap ki kya madad karun?",'Offline main live mausam nahi dekh sakta. \ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Settings \u2192 Online services & AI mein "Free online AI" on karein to main aur topics par bhi madad kar sakta hoon.',"Cloud reputation (Cloudflare)","Cloudflare ka security filter is site ko malware ya phishing ke taur par BLOCK karta hai. Na kholein.","Cloudflare ki malware / phishing block list mein nahi hai.","Yeh check nahi chal saka (internet nahi, ya Settings \u2192 Online services mein band hai).","Set up nahi hai. Iske liye free Google key chahiye: Settings \u2192 Online services & AI. Upar wala Cloudflare check bina key ke pehle hi chal raha hai.","Link kholein","Progress","Unlock ho gaya!","Inaam","Aapka sara data is phone se delete ho gaya.","Feedback bhejein","Batayein kya behtar karna hai ya masla report karein","{x} ki taraf se mohabbat se banaya gaya","Cloud security filters (Cloudflare / Google) is message ke ek link ko khatarnak batate hain.","Cloud security filters (Cloudflare / Google) is website ko khatarnak batate hain. Na kholein.","Remote VPN (WireGuard)","Aapka SAARA traffic aapke chune hue dusre mulk ke server se guzarta hai. IP aur mulk badal jata hai aur jo sites aapka provider block karta hai woh khul jati hain.","Free tareeqa: free ProtonVPN account banayein \u2192 Downloads \u2192 WireGuard configuration \u2192 Free server chunein \u2192 Create \u2192 text copy karke yahan paste karein. Koi bhi WireGuard config chalti hai.","WireGuard config paste karein","Yeh WireGuard config nahi lagti","Config is phone par (encrypted) save hai","Config hatayein","Connect karein","Disconnect karein","Mera IP dekhein","Aapka IP","Connect nahi ho saka","Remote VPN on hone par Shield ka local filter ruk jata hai (Android mein ek waqt mein ek hi VPN chalta hai).","ShieldPal ko sikhayein","Nateeja ghalat tha? On-device AI ko batayein ke yeh message asal mein kya hai. Woh aapke phone par seekhta hai aur aapke liye behtar hota jata hai.","Yeh SCAM hai","Yeh safe hai","Shukriya! ShieldPal ne is se seekha.","Ab tak sikhaye gaye messages: {x}","Cyber tips","Saari tips","+{x} \ud83e\ude99 aaj ki tip parhne par","Aaj parh li","Aur tips","Sab","Links","Messages","Apps","Websites","QR","{x} pakde gaye \xb7 {y} par tawajjo chahiye","Sab handle ho gaye","Sab handle ho gaye mark ho gaye","Aaj ki cyber tip","Bahar nikalne ke liye dobara back dabayein",'Aapne is number ko scam mark kiya hai, isliye ShieldPal ise khatarnak dikhata hai. Agar ghalti se kiya to "Meri scam mark hatayein" dabayein.',"Is number mein koi khatre ki nishani nahi mili.","{x} khatre ki nishani mili, neeche red flags dekhein.","Is naam se save","Aapke contacts mein nahi","Contacts se naam dikhayein?","ShieldPal aapke saved contacts mein is number ka naam dhoond sakta hai. Yeh sirf phone par hota hai aur contacts kabhi upload nahi hote.","Yeh browser mein public website kholte hain. Inhein ShieldPal nahi chalata aur nateeje ghalat ho sakte hain. SIM ka asli malik private hota hai, sirf operator aur police trace kar sakti hai.","Meri scam mark hatayein","Online services & AI","Free AI, link checks, keys aur kya bheja jata hai","ShieldPal poori tarah offline chalta hai. Yeh optional online services ise aur smart banati hain. Har card batata hai ke kya karta hai aur bilkul kya bheja jata hai. Jab tak aap woh feature istemal na karein kuch nahi jata. Test dabayein aur dekhein ke sach mein chalta hai.","Bheja jata hai","Test","Free key lein","Key chahiye","Pehle key daalein","Chal raha hai!","Nahi chala (internet check karein)","Key reject hui ya internet nahi","Connect hua, lekin test site flag nahi hui","Free online AI","Pal AI ko ChatGPT ki tarah aapki zaban mein har cheez par baat karne deta hai. Na key, na account.","aapke chat messages (password ya code kabhi nahi)","Free online AI istemal karein","Behtareen jawab ke liye Anthropic ka Claude. Aapko apni API key chahiye (paise aap dete hain).","aapke chat messages, aapki key ke saath","Cloudflare ke security DNS se poochta hai ke link ki website malware ya phishing to nahi. Bina key ke chalta hai.","sirf website ka naam (jaise example.com), poora link nahi","Links Cloudflare se check karein","Google ki khatarnak sites ki list. Har check kiye link par doosri raye.","link ka address",'Key kaise lein (free): Google Cloud Console kholein, project banayein, "Safe Browsing API" enable karein, phir Credentials \u2192 Create API key. Yahan paste karein.',"Link ko aapke phone se door ek mehfooz cloud browser mein kholta hai aur screenshot dikhata hai. Free urlscan.io account ki key chahiye.","link ka address (scan unlisted rehta hai)","Password Check Have I Been Pwned se poochta hai ke password leak mein tha ya nahi. Bina key ke chalta hai.","password ke fingerprint ke sirf pehle 5 huroof","Privacy Policy","Aakhri update","Web version kholein","Data safety","Kya jama, share aur save hota hai","Aasan khulasa, wohi jawab jo hum Google Play ko dete hain. Poori tafseel Privacy Policy mein hai.","Hum koi data jama nahi karte","ShieldPal mein account aur server nahi hai. Hum aapka naam, email, phone number, location ya contacts jama nahi karte.","Phone par check hota hai","Messages, notifications, apps ki list, Deep Scan, Number Check, QR codes aur scam AI model sab device par chalte hain aur kabhi upload nahi hote.","Encrypted storage","2FA secrets, keys aur PIN Android Keystore se encrypted hain. Online requests HTTPS istemal karti hain.","Aap sab kuch delete kar sakte hain",'Neeche "Delete all my data" dabayein ya app uninstall karein. Server par kuch nahi rehta.',"Na ads, na tracking, na farokht","ShieldPal mein ads aur analytics nahi, aur aapka data kabhi becha ya share nahi hota.","Optional: sirf jab aap feature istemal karein","Link Check","Website ka naam Cloudflare ko jata hai. Poora link Google Safe Browsing ya urlscan.io ko sirf tab jab aap apni key daalein.","Password Check","Hash ke sirf 5 huroof Have I Been Pwned ko jate hain. Password kabhi nahi.","Pal AI","Default mein offline. Free online AI on karein (ya Claude key daalein) to aapki chat ka text us service ko jata hai.","Shield VPN","Phone par local VPN. Koi traffic ShieldPal ko nahi jata. DNS lookups aapke chune hue DNS server (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9...) ko jate hain.","Mera sab data delete karein","Is phone se settings, threat log, 2FA codes, keys aur pet ki progress mita dein","Yeh ShieldPal ka is phone par save har cheez hamesha ke liye mita dega, 2FA codes aur PIN samet. Wapas nahi aayega.","DNS server","Server {x} par badal gaya","Connection test karein","Internet test karein","Time out","Block","Fail","Malware test site (block honi chahiye)","Shield VPN ek local DNS shield hai: yeh khatarnak websites block karta hai aur aapka phone jo DNS server istemal karta hai woh badalta hai, jis se woh sites bhi khul jati hain jo aapka provider sirf DNS level par block karta hai. Yeh aapka IP chhupata ya mulk nahi badalta, kyunke uske liye remote VPN server chahiye.","Cloudflare Security","Malware aur phishing block (tajweez shuda)","Cloudflare Family","Malware, phishing aur adult sites block","Cloudflare Fast","Sab se tez, koi filter nahi. Block sites ke liye achha","Google DNS","Bharosemand, koi filter nahi","Quad9","Malware block, privacy par tawajjo","AdGuard","Ads aur trackers block","OpenDNS","Mustahkam, optional filter","Apna pet chunein","Billi","Khargosh","Reechh","Kutta","Lomri","Pet ki awaaz","Larki, larka ya cute awaaz, raftaar aur speaker","Chunein ke {pet} warnings kaise bole. Style dabayein aur sunein.","Hello! Main {pet} hoon. Jab scam link aaye ga main aap ko bataunga. Mehfooz rahein!","Larki","Cute pet","Normal","Larka","Bhari","Fine tune","Sur","Raftaar","Is phone ki awaazein","Phone ki default","Is zaban ki koi aur awaaz nahi mili. Android Settings \u2192 Text-to-speech mein aur install kar sakte hain."],t.w)
